//  the demo: your debug master hangs off its own free-running clock and the
//  clock converter does the crossing. Hang it directly on hsci_pclk and your
//  debug path drops out as soon as the XPLL loses lock.
//
//  NOTE -- consequence of putting axi_hsci on hsci_pclk:
//  the register HSCI_RATE_CTRL[8] (hsci_pll_reset) puts the XPLL into reset,
