//  can no longer write it back to 0 -- only a new bitstream or an external
//  reset helps then. Out of reset the bit is 0, so start-up works fine. If you
//  really want to use that bit, give axi_hsci its own s_axi_aclk (for example
//  clk_out2) and let axi_hsci's internal CDC do the work.
// ***************************************************************************

